- Explained CXR: pneumonia improving, COPD/emphysematous changes present. Reassured lungs “damaged but not totally stuffed”, but stressed risk if he keeps missing meds / still smoking.
- Reiterated importance of completing courses – flagged that stopping abx/pred early ↑risk relapse and rehosp.
